+// operation-darkness-nx (2026-11-13, from renut_nx_ultimate_base: blur-nx's CG-13, its ports 123 and 133): with
+// REX_FPCR_ONE_MODE the host's flush mode stays on for all guest code: a guest thread sets it at start (InitHost), any
